<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>针灸理论 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.1</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Jan 2026 10:20:45 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>考订经脉篇第十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-17/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 15:34:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-17/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>这份《考订经脉篇第十七》的内容非常丰富，它不仅仅是解剖学上的经脉走向描述，更是一部**“经脉气化动力学”&lt;strong&gt;。岐伯的回答揭示了经脉运行背后的深层逻辑——即&lt;/strong&gt;五行生克、脏腑伦理（君臣父子夫妇）以及天人相应**的哲学原理。</description></item><item><title>气府论篇第五十九</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE59%E6%B0%94%E5%BA%9C%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE59%E6%B0%94%E5%BA%9C%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了足三阳经、手三阳经及奇经八脉的脉气循行路线及其对应穴位分布，共计三百六十五穴，与天地之气相应。</description></item><item><title>气穴论篇第五十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE58%E6%B0%94%E7%A9%B4%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE58%E6%B0%94%E7%A9%B4%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了人体三百六十五气穴的分布位置及其与病理、治疗的关系，同时解释了孙络和溪谷在疾病传变和治疗中的重要作用。</description></item><item><title>血气形志篇第二十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE24%E8%A1%80%E6%B0%94%E5%BD%A2%E5%BF%97%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE24%E8%A1%80%E6%B0%94%E5%BD%A2%E5%BF%97%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>系统阐述了人体六经气血分布规律（太阳多血少气、阳明多气多血等）、手足三阴三阳经的表里关系，详细说明了五脏背俞穴的取穴方法，并指出情志致病特点及相应治法，最后规范了六经针刺的出血出气禁忌。</description></item></channel></rss>